DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nAverage speed: 18-20mph\n
 \nDue to the race-like style of this ride\, including pacelining at high s
 peeds\, the use of E-bikes is not recommended.\n\n25 mile rolling route:\n
 \nOdd dates: CC Tuesday Fitness Ride Odd Days (25R)\nEven dates: CC Tuesda
 y Fitness Ride Even Days (26R)\n\nFor links to both cues:\n[https://routes
 .lancasterbikeclub.net/?l=7&t&c&mi&k=tuesday%20fitness](https://routes.lan
 casterbikeclub.net/?l=7&t&c&mi&k=tuesday%20fitness)\n\nBring lights as nee
 ded\; Helmets are mandatory\; No ear buds. Please bring water\, and a basi
 c repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nHelmets ar
 e mandatory\; No ear buds or audible music playing devices. Please bring w
 ater\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflato
 r).\n\nTo eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we encourage L
 BC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. RSVP also allo
 ws us to contact you after the ride if needed. If you do not RSVP you are 
 not covered by the club excess accident insurance policy\; only club membe
 rs who RSVP are covered. Being on Meetup does not mean you are a club memb
 er. Join here- [https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&
 club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&
 club_id=257148)\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code
  of Conduct: [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22
 &club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/con
 tent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nRules of the Road: 
 [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2571
 48&module_id=325159 ](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?pa
 ge_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)\nand\nRide Waiver: [https://lanc
